# Shared roles.
#
# v1 relies on Infisical's built-in project roles (admin / member / viewer /
# no-access) assigned per project by modules/infisical-project. A narrower
# custom organization role for the apply identity (replacing `admin`) belongs
# here as an `infisical_org_role` once the required permission set is proven
# in the provider acceptance suite (docs/PROVIDER_COMPATIBILITY.md).
